maya: I'll standardize on `resume_token` in frontmatter and add the short explainer: "resume_token (opaque server-provided marker)". Merge after tiny nits fixed.
eli: Pushed TS fix and wording tweak. CI green.
maya: Merged. Thanks all! :tada:
